    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>The perfect place to plan revenge.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unravel the third chapter of the <i>Myst </i>saga, and embark on a desperate hunt through the Ages for an embittered villain whose vengeance threatens to eradicate an entire civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Myst III: Exile</i> continues the story of familial betrayal and timeless conflicts. Featuring 6 new awe-inspiring Ages explore and dozens of puzzles to solve as you search for the elusive villain Saavedro. Time is against you as you attempt to unravel his madness and reveal the dark secrets of the brothers Sirrus and Achenar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy the six new worlds of <i>Myst III: Exile</i>, featuring a free-look movement system that allows you to view 360\u00b0 at every location.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>The perfect place to plan revenge.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unravel the third chapter of the <i>Myst </i>saga, and embark on a desperate hunt through the Ages for an embittered villain whose vengeance threatens to eradicate an entire civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Myst III: Exile</i> continues the story of familial betrayal and timeless conflicts. Featuring 6 new awe-inspiring Ages explore and dozens of puzzles to solve as you search for the elusive villain Saavedro. Time is against you as you attempt to unravel his madness and reveal the dark secrets of the brothers Sirrus and Achenar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy the six new worlds of <i>Myst III: Exile</i>, featuring a free-look movement system that allows you to view 360\u00b0 at every location.</p>",
    "short_description": "The story of Myst continues in this third entry of the series, originally released in 2001. Return to this strange and wondrous universe, where books become portals into worlds, and where the lessons of the past may yet hold meaning for today...",
